---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="பொறுப்புத் துறப்பு | Disclaimer — Elvan Navil"
  description="Legal and informational disclaimer for Elvan Navil studio, Nammil desktop companion, linguistic tools, and Google AdSense advertising."
  canonicalPath="/disclaimer"
  mobileTitle="பொறுப்புத்துறப்பு|disclaimer"
  backUrl="/"
>
  <div class="page-view animate-entry" style="max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 16px 20px 40px;">
    <header class="disclaimer-hero">
      <div class="disclaimer-badge">சட்ட மறுப்புரை • LEGAL DISCLAIMER</div>
      <h1 class="disclaimer-title">பொறுப்புத் துறப்பு • Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="disclaimer-subtitle">Transparency, trademark notices, and content disclosures for Elvan Navil</p>
    </header>

    <section class="disclaimer-card">
      <h2 class="disclaimer-section-title">1. பொதுவான தகவல் மறுப்புரை • General Information Disclaimer</h2>
      <p class="disclaimer-p">
        All information, literary compositions, articles, essays, and educational tools published on <strong>Elvan Navil</strong> (https://elvannavil.vercel.app) are provided in good faith for cultural, linguistic, educational, and creative enjoyment.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="disclaimer-card">
      <h2 class="disclaimer-section-title">2. மூன்றாம் தரப்பு வர்த்தக முத்திரைகள் • Trademark Notice</h2>
      <ul class="disclaimer-ul">
        <li><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> WhatsApp is a registered trademark of Meta Platforms, Inc. The <strong>Nammil (நம்மில்)</strong> desktop application is an independent client-side companion software and is <em>not affiliated with, authorized, maintained, sponsored, or endorsed by Meta Platforms, Inc. or WhatsApp</em>.</li>
        <li><strong>Google &amp; Google AdSense:</strong> Google is a registered trademark of Google LLC. Advertising displayed on this website is served by Google AdSense adhering strictly to their publisher guidelines.</li>
        <li><strong>Windows:</strong> Windows is a registered trademark of Microsoft Corporation.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="disclaimer-card">
      <h2 class="disclaimer-section-title">3. விளம்பரங்கள் மற்றும் ஆட்சென்ஸ் வெளிப்படைத்தன்மை • Advertising Disclosure</h2>
      <p class="disclaimer-p">
        To maintain our digital studio, support hosting infrastructure, and continue providing free software and bilingual literature, this website displays contextual advertisements provided by Google AdSense and its certified partners.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="disclaimer-card">
      <h2 class="disclaimer-section-title">4. மொழி மற்றும் இலக்கணக் கருவிகள் • Linguistic &amp; Synthesizer Tools</h2>
      <p class="disclaimer-p">
        Our linguistic tools—including the <strong>Navil Transliterator</strong> and <strong>Navil Arichuvadi</strong>—are engineered based on Tolkappiyam phonetic principles and historical orthographic models. Machine transliterations should be manually reviewed for formal or legal documentation.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .disclaimer-hero { text-align: center; padding: 32px 16px 24px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .disclaimer-badge {
    display: inline-flex; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 100px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--text-main) 8%, transparent); color: var(--text-main);
    font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .disclaimer-title { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.7rem); font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-main); margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .disclaimer-subtitle { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .disclaimer-card {
    background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-light); border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .disclaimer-section-title { font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-main); margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .disclaimer-p, .disclaimer-ul { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .disclaimer-ul { padding-left: 20px; }
  .disclaimer-ul li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
</style>
